! XRT-14 P1(IOL 17.15)= P ルータ。IS-IS と LDP だけで、BGP は持たない。RR1 への線は MPLS を動かさない(道の外)。
! 据付の方策= Et0/0 の入力(XR01 から)で EXP ごとに数えるだけ(採点が数える・M12-1)/Et0/1 の入力(PE2 から)で EXP 3 → 1 に格下げ(混雑時の扱いの模擬・M12-3)。
mpls label protocol ldp
mpls ldp router-id Loopback0 force
!
class-map match-any EXP5
 match mpls experimental topmost 5
class-map match-any EXP3
 match mpls experimental topmost 3
class-map match-any EXP1
 match mpls experimental topmost 1
class-map match-any EXP0
 match mpls experimental topmost 0
!
policy-map COUNT-EXP
 class EXP5
 class EXP3
 class EXP1
 class EXP0
policy-map DOWNGRADE
 class EXP3
  set mpls experimental topmost 1
!
interface Loopback0
 ip address 10.255.0.51 255.255.255.255
 ip router isis CORE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description CORE to XR01
 ip address 10.0.1.51 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 service-policy input COUNT-EXP
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description CORE to PE2
 ip address 10.0.2.51 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 mpls ip
 service-policy input DOWNGRADE
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[2] }}
 description to RR1 (route reflector, off the forwarding path)
 ip address 10.0.52.51 255.255.255.0
 ip router isis CORE
 isis network point-to-point
 no shutdown
!
router isis CORE
 net 49.0001.0100.0000.0051.00
 is-type level-2-only
 metric-style wide
 log-adjacency-changes
!
